@startuml
participant "Secure Storage" as PKCS11
participant "Security Manager" as TR181
participant "USP Agent" as OBUSPA
participant "Provisioning Controller" as ProvController
participant "Certificate Authority" as CA
participant "USP Controller" as USPController

OBUSPA -> OBUSPA: Load provisioning certificate in SSL context
OBUSPA -> ProvController: Connect (mTLS using pre-embedded certificate)

note over OBUSPA: Acts as a USP Agent

ProvController -> OBUSPA: Device.Security.CreateCSR(KeyType: "RSA"\nKeyLength: 2048\nCN: "mydevice.bbf.org"\nO: "BBF"\nC: "US"\nName: "ServiceA"\nRenewalMode: "Renew"\nRenewalInterval: 30)
activate OBUSPA
OBUSPA -> TR181: Device.Security.CreateCSR(KeyType: "RSA"\nKeyLength: 2048\nCN: "mydevice.bbf.org"\nO: "BBF"\nC: "US"\nName: "ServiceA"\nRenewalMode: "Renew"\nRenewalInterval: 30)
activate TR181

TR181 --> OBUSPA: CreateCSRResponse(CommandKey: <CommandKey>)
OBUSPA --> ProvController: CreateCSRResponse(CommandKey: <CommandKey>)

TR181 -> PKCS11: Initialize_PIN()
TR181 -> PKCS11: Generate_KeyPair()

TR181 -> ProvController: CSRCreated!(CommandKey: <CommandKey>\nName: <name>\nEncodedCSR: <CSR data>)
deactivate TR181
deactivate OBUSPA

ProvController -> CA: Sign CSR / Certificate
CA --> ProvController: Sign Complete

ProvController -> OBUSPA: Device.Security.AddCertificate(Certificate: <PEM data>\nName: <name>\nMatchToCSR: true)
activate OBUSPA
OBUSPA -> TR181: Device.Security.AddCertificate(Certificate: <PEM data>\nName: <name>\nMatchToCSR: true)
activate TR181
TR181 -> TR181: Install Certificate to Secure Storage
TR181 --> OBUSPA: AddCertificateResponse(CommandKey: <CommandKey>)
OBUSPA --> ProvController: AddCertificateResponse(CommandKey: <CommandKey>)
deactivate TR181
deactivate OBUSPA

OBUSPA -> OBUSPA: Load new Certificate
OBUSPA -> USPController: Connect

@enduml
